# ================= TL;DR =================
h1('TL;DR')
para("Most business owners I talk to sound exactly like everyone else in their niche, and their views show it. Inayah McMillan is the clearest example I've seen of someone fixing that.")
para("She teaches people how to make money with Airbnb and digital products, which is one of the most crowded corners of YouTube. The very first video we made together, \"How I Brainwashed Myself to Be a Millionaire at 20\", is now past **1.1 million views.**")
para("We made three changes, and you can copy all of them:")
bullets(['Found the one thing she can say that almost nobody else in her niche can.',
         'Borrowed a title format that had already worked twice for a bigger creator with the same audience.',
         'Wrote a hook that starts her story in the second line, then turns it around to the viewer.'], numbered=True)
para("Below you'll find each step, the numbers (including the ones that don't flatter us), and a worked example for a consulting or service business. You don't need to be in her niche, and you don't need 256,000 subscribers.")

